      "id": "claim_e4098f38d98c4902808d40f857103021",
      "statement": "Start-and-wait endpoints return 202 Accepted with the REQUEST_TIMED_OUT_START_AND_WAIT message when the underlying wait for an in-flight pipeline expires, in contrast to plain start endpoints, which return 200 immediately with a processing message.",
