      "id": "claim_f1c19aa5b1a64a6ba80a18923e099f2d",
      "statement": "The openwiki/ directory is generated documentation maintained through the repository's documented maintenance process and a scheduled GitHub Actions workflow (.github/workflows/openwiki.yml, weekly cron Monday 06:00 UTC calling the ardoco/actions openwiki workflow); AGENTS.md instructs contributors to refresh generated pages after source changes rather than hand-edit them, and to treat source code and tests as authoritative.",
