    {
      "id": "claim_9374921e639740488bc10876b959d203",
      "statement": "JSON handling is Jackson 3 (tools.jackson): controllers, services, and converters use tools.jackson.databind.json.JsonMapper (JsonMapper.shared() in converters) and AbstractController.parseAdditionalConfigs catches tools.jackson.core.JacksonException, while the response DTOs (ArdocoResultResponse, ArDoCoApiResult, ErrorResponse) keep com.fasterxml.jackson.annotation annotations, which Jackson 3 continues to honor; the Spring Boot dependency management (spring-boot-dependencies BOM) supplies these versions on top of the ardoco parent POM.",
