    {
      "id": "claim_761443708ebe41909cd7de3c4dc7ba32",
      "statement": "Browser CORS access is gated by WebConfig: it reads cors.allowed-origins as a comma-separated list (entries trimmed, empties dropped; default https://ardoco.de in application.properties, overridable via the CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS environment variable) and, when at least one origin remains, registers a single CORS mapping for /api/** allowing only GET and POST with credentials disabled; an empty value disables CORS entirely, and the local Spring profile additionally allows the localhost origins http://localhost:3000 and http://localhost:8000.",
